    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract policy interface for external metadata catalog exports. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_catalog_exporter" kindref="compound">CatalogExporter</ref> consults this policy before pushing metadata to Apache Atlas or DataHub, enabling deployments to exclude internal tables, rate-limit exports, or batch updates.</para>
<para>Implementations MUST be thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
